      "text": "The measured excess passes both POL-RD-01 gates. The governing field is the trace figure, 17.60 km, measured against the booked optimal of 13.50 km stored on the trip_record at booking — an excess of 4.10 km, or 30.37% of optimal, which is greater than the 0.8 km absolute gate and greater than the 20% gate. I cite the trace figure and not trip_record.actual_distance_km because POL-RD-01 makes gps_trace.trace_distance_km govern and expressly forbids citing the rounded convenience copy for the threshold test. I disclose that the artifact carrying this figure, EV-GPS-04003, is impaired: weight_multiplier 0.6, issue code GPS_GAP_LONG_INSIDE_WINDOW.",
