      "text": "No exculpatory clause can answer the excess. The bundle holds no traffic advisory for this trip — EV-ADVIS-04003-01 is MISSING and carries weight 0.0 — so the corridor test in POL-RD-03 cannot be run on this record and no closure can be shown to affect a road the optimal route traverses. The chat log holds two messages only, a driver arrival notice and the rider's 'ok 1 min'; neither names a road or a place the driver could act on, and neither message carries a waypoint_hint, so POL-RD-04 is unavailable — its corroboration test is undecidable where waypoint_hint is null and no road is named. Under POL-RD-08 the driver must point to a specific artifact and a specific clause, and on this record there is none to point to.",
