      "text": "The rider's side of the POL-RD-08 burden is discharged on identity. trip_record, gps_trace and fare_breakdown all carry trip_id TRP-04003; the trace's first fix 14:00:10 matches trip_record.started_at and its last fix 14:26:06 matches trip_record.ended_at; and the excess meets the POL-RD-01 threshold. That shifts the burden to the driver, who has filed no statement at all — counterparty_statement is null — and cites no artifact. I disclose that the trace I rely on for the excess is impaired (weight 0.6; issue code GPS_GAP_LONG_INSIDE_WINDOW).",
