    },
    {
      "text": "The trace is impaired for policy purposes, and POL-RD-07(iii) fixes what follows. It is tagged GPS_GAP_LONG_INSIDE_WINDOW at weight 0.6, and it meets POL-RD-07(a) (a 450 second interval between consecutive fixes, against the 90 second limit) and POL-RD-07(b) (an 8,489.6 m straight-line step, against the 500 m limit). I do not assert corroboration I cannot show: the chat log contains no route admission by the driver, the counterparty statement is null, no ERP gantry was charged on the fare breakdown, and trip_record.actual_distance_km of 17.60 km is, on the artifact's own notes, the trace figure rounded to one decimal place — not the independent derivation POL-RD-07(ii) demands. The consequence is not NO_ACTION: POL-RD-07(iii) makes a data failure of this kind an ESCALATE, so the disputed amount is held rather than collected, and it does not pass to the driver.",
