      "text": "The platform-wide confidence floor is engaged independently of POL-RD-07. Whether this trip deviated is carried by a single artifact, the gps_trace, tagged GPS_GAP_LONG_INSIDE_WINDOW at weight_multiplier 0.6; no second independent artifact carries the deciding fact. Under POL-GEN-02(2) confidence in the ruling cannot exceed that 0.6, which is below the 0.70 floor, so POL-RD-10(1) mandates escalation on its own. The rider's protection is that escalation holds the money rather than leaving it with the operator.",
